    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：Use fpi == 6 and only the last statpers for each anndats_act. Define surp = (actual - meanest)/price. Define a firm-anndats as a streak if surp has the same sign as the most recent surp observation. Keep only streaks. Then define signal = surp. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=0.2；PortfolioPeriod=1.0个月；StartMonth=12.0；Sign=1.0；TestInOP=port sort FF3 alpha。股票池/过滤：abs(prc)>5。 Notes：Table 3's footnote says stocks remain in the relevant portfolio for 6 months, which we take to mean that earnings announcements more than 6 months old are not used. Announcements are quarterly anyway, so the rankings need to change quarterly. We reassign portfolios monthly because earnings announcements occur throughout the year. This was updated in 2021 February. Old version was much simpler.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
    },
